Better yet, let's order some hot dogs.

138
00:07:50,160 --> 00:07:51,160
All right.

139
00:07:51,160 --> 00:07:54,540
Now this is a great phrase, as you say, Marco, for offering a suggestion.

140
00:07:55,240 --> 00:07:58,840
You could say, I think we should eat hamburgers.

141
00:07:58,840 --> 00:07:59,020
Better yet.

142
00:07:59,840 --> 00:08:00,840
Okay.

143
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:01,840
So what does this mean?

144
00:08:01,840 --> 00:08:07,000
This means I actually had a better idea while I was telling you my other idea.

145
00:08:07,000 --> 00:08:09,720
So it can be used in the middle of a sentence like here, right?

146
00:08:10,080 --> 00:08:11,180
It's kind of like an interjection.

147
00:08:11,720 --> 00:08:12,480
Better yet, you know what?

148
00:08:13,520 --> 00:08:14,160
Let's get some pizza.

149
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:18,060
So it's better than the idea you just had.

150
00:08:18,640 --> 00:08:19,640
Right.

151
00:08:19,640 --> 00:08:19,900
So let's go swimming.

152
00:08:21,080 --> 00:08:22,420
Better yet, let's go play basketball.

153
00:08:23,120 --> 00:08:24,120
Right.

154
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,120
Exactly.

155
00:08:25,120 --> 00:08:28,520
So towards the end, our friend said, you know what?

156
00:08:28,520 --> 00:08:29,080
You're a lost cause.

157
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,140
What does that mean?

158
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:30,980
What does this phrase mean?

159
00:08:31,720 --> 00:08:32,720
You're a lost cause.

160
00:08:32,720 --> 00:08:33,120
You're a lost cause.

161
00:08:33,880 --> 00:08:34,800
It's an interesting phrase.

162
00:08:35,500 --> 00:08:41,400
This is basically a way of saying I can do nothing to change you.

163
00:08:42,200 --> 00:08:50,080
You have a bad habit or you have this bad quality and anything I do, it's not going to help.

164
00:08:50,080 --> 00:08:51,080
Right.

165
00:08:51,080 --> 00:08:53,740
So something that is a lost cause, it means it's hopeless, helpless.

166
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:55,640
That's right.

167
00:08:55,640 --> 00:08:56,860
I cannot do anything to change it.

168
00:08:57,360 --> 00:08:57,520
Okay.

169
