187
00:09:44,260 --> 00:09:47,060
So talking about junk food, we took a look at cholesterol.

188
00:09:47,960 --> 00:09:51,220
Now apparently not all cholesterol is bad.

189
00:09:51,800 --> 00:09:52,280
That's right.

190
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:55,800
There are two kinds of cholesterol, HDLs and LDLs.

191
00:09:56,220 --> 00:09:58,780
One kind is good for you and the other kind is bad for you.

192
00:09:58,880 --> 00:10:06,350
So it's important when you talk to your doctor, you ask your doctor if the bad cholesterol is high for you.

193
00:10:06,710 --> 00:10:10,670
Because if it's the good cholesterol that's high, you're probably not going to experience health problems.

194
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:19,080
But if you have really high bad cholesterol, then that's something that you should think about when you eat and when you choose the kinds of foods that you eat.

195
00:10:19,080 --> 00:10:27,520
So usually, my doctor always used to tell me to not eat so many eggs because eggs are high in cholesterol.

196
00:10:27,520 --> 00:10:27,650
That's right.

197
00:10:28,520 --> 00:10:31,270
Red meat and eggs and salty foods I think.

198
00:10:32,530 --> 00:10:38,040
But generally speaking, I think it's good just to eat a lot of vegetables and to balance out your diet.

199
00:10:38,580 --> 00:10:40,180
So vegetables don't really even have cholesterol.

200
00:10:40,560 --> 00:10:41,560
No.

201
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:48,840
They have high cholesterol and I think they also have a lot of vitamins and minerals that your body needs.

202
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:56,740
It's very, very interesting because actually all food that is usually very, very delicious is high in cholesterol or high in calories.

203
00:10:57,160 --> 00:10:57,640
It's bad for you.

204
00:10:57,720 --> 00:10:58,660
It's basically junk food.

205
00:10:59,160 --> 00:11:00,160
Yeah.

206
00:11:00,160 --> 00:11:09,320
So potato chips, hot dogs, pizza, fried chicken, all of these delicious foods, they're all considered junk food and they're all really bad for you.

207
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:09,500
That's right.

208
00:11:10,320 --> 00:11:11,680
